{"id":"mercanci_a","lemma":"mercancía","pos":"noun","rank":3100,"glosses":["ware, merchandise","goods, wares (commodity offered for sale; an article of commerce)"],"ipa":"/meɾkanˈθia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mercancías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-mercanc%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Las mercancías llegaron ayer.","en":"The goods arrived yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734454","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"No toque la mercancía, por favor.","en":"Please don't touch the merchandise.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"a touch"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"please"]]},{"text":"Vi a alguien robar la mercancía.","en":"I saw somebody steal the merchandise.","words":[{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"someone, somebody"},{"g":"to rob"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Se ha retrasado mucho el despacho de esa mercancía.","en":"That shipment's been very much delayed.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"delayed, retarded"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"dispatch"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]}]}